{"slug":"Universal-Script-Enable-Jump-in-any-game-139117","_id":"69bf8a306e5b21dac2549f26","title":"Enable Jump in any game","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"All this script does is give the ability to jump in games that disable jumping\n\nI only tested this on mobile and it works in literally any game almost. It should work on other devices\n\nTo use it all you have to do is execute the script in a game (that disables jumping),  and once executed the jumping button should appear","tags":["Free","Universal","Jumping","Script"],"script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal player = Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal loopThread = nil\n\nlocal function fixCharacter(char)\n\tif loopThread then\n\t\ttask.cancel(loopThread)\n\t\tloopThread = nil\n\tend\n\n\tlocal humanoid = char:WaitForChild(\"Humanoid\", 10)\n\tif not humanoid then return end\n\n\tloopThread = task.spawn(function()\n\t\twhile humanoid and humanoid.Parent do\n\t\t\tpcall(function()\n\t\t\t\tif not humanoid:GetStateEnabled(Enum.HumanoidStateType.Jumping) then\n\t\t\t\t\thumanoid:SetStateEnabled(Enum.HumanoidStateType.Jumping, true)\n\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\tif humanoid.UseJumpPower then\n\t\t\t\t\tif humanoid.JumpPower <= 0 then\n\t\t\t\t\t\thumanoid.JumpPower = 50\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t\t\tif humanoid.JumpHeight <= 0 then\n\t\t\t\t\t\thumanoid.JumpHeight = 7.2\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend)\n\n\t\t\ttask.wait(2)\n\t\tend\n\tend)\nend\n\nlocal char = player.Character or player.CharacterAdded:Wait()\nfixCharacter(char)\nplayer.CharacterAdded:Connect(fixCharacter)","owner":{"_id":"69141eec4b45e134829a5eb6","username":"ScripterLollz","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/f5e9fb6b562da28e68e3d94c0613c2de0d5a66eb6906a63a35a